1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,037
In this town, once a year, it rains pets.

2
00:00:04,027 --> 00:00:05,489
Not cats and dogs.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,725
Well, yes, cats and dogs.

4
00:00:08,293 --> 00:00:10,060
But also hamsters. Parrots. Goldfish.

5
00:00:10,627 --> 00:00:12,089
One year, a llama.

6
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,931
Everyone runs outside with nets and umbrellas.

7
00:00:15,727 --> 00:00:18,098
Whatever lands in your yard is yours.

8
00:00:18,893 --> 00:00:20,052
That's the rule.

9
00:00:20,693 --> 00:00:22,458
This year, I was ready.

10
00:00:23,027 --> 00:00:24,489
Biggest net in town.

11
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,422
Blanket on the grass.

12
00:00:26,893 --> 00:00:28,355
I wanted a puppy.

13
00:00:28,827 --> 00:00:30,289
The clouds turned pink.

14
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,525
The first pets started falling.

15
00:00:33,093 --> 00:00:33,646
Puppies.

16
00:00:34,893 --> 00:00:35,446
Kittens.

17
00:00:36,693 --> 00:00:38,169
A very confused turtle.

18
00:00:38,627 --> 00:00:40,695
My neighbor caught a golden retriever.

19
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:43,428
My best friend caught twin bunnies.

20
00:00:44,093 --> 00:00:45,252
I caught nothing.

21
00:00:45,893 --> 00:00:47,355
Not one single pet.

22
00:00:47,827 --> 00:00:49,289
The sky went quiet.

23
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,222
Everyone went home happy.

24
00:00:51,693 --> 00:00:53,155
Then I heard it.

25
00:00:53,627 --> 00:00:54,786
A tiny squeak.

26
00:00:55,427 --> 00:00:56,586
Under my net.

27
00:00:57,227 --> 00:00:58,083
A puppy.

28
00:00:59,027 --> 00:01:00,489
Smallest I've ever seen.

29
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,422
I called him Pebble.

30
00:01:02,893 --> 00:01:04,962
But Pebble didn't eat dog food.

31
00:01:05,627 --> 00:01:06,786
Pebble didn't bark.

32
00:01:07,427 --> 00:01:09,192
And every night, Pebble grew.

33
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:13,040
One week later, Pebble was as big as the house.

34
00:01:14,127 --> 00:01:16,197
The mayor called an emergency meeting.

35
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:18,322
Pebble wasn't a puppy.

36
00:01:18,793 --> 00:01:20,558
Pebble was a baby cloud.

37
00:01:21,127 --> 00:01:22,589
And somewhere up there...

38
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:25,128
his mom was looking for him.

39
00:01:25,793 --> 00:01:27,255
That's why this year...

40
00:01:27,727 --> 00:01:29,492
it rained for forty days.

